y; text-indent: 30pt; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:阿里巴巴普惠体\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:阿里巴巴普惠体\">超长期特别国债主要投向科技创新、城乡融合发展、区域协调发展、粮食能源安全、人口高质量发展等细分领域，形成的重大项目客观上有利于扩大总需求，提振市场信心，夯实中国经济回升向好的基础。<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>粤开证券首席经济学家罗志恒表示。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:阿里巴巴普惠体\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section style=\"margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space-collapse: collapse; justify-content: flex-start; display: flex; flex-flow: row; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; display: inline-block; width: auto; vertical-align: top; align-self: flex-start; flex: 0 0 auto; border-style: solid; border-width: 0px 0px 4px; border-bottom-color: rgb(13, 80, 199); min-width: 5%; height: auto; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; justify-content: flex-start; display: flex; flex-flow: row; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 12px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; display: inline-block; width: 160.359px; vertical-align: top; align-self: flex-start; flex: 0 0 auto; border-style: solid; border-width: 2px 2px 0px; border-color: rgb(255, 205, 104) rgb(255, 205, 104) rgb(97, 163, 246); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; text-align: justify; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">强化要素配置保障</strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: unset; white-space-collapse: collapse; line-height: 2; letter-spacing: 1px; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:阿里巴巴普惠体\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 30pt; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:阿里巴巴普惠体\">多地在强调加紧项目建设的同时，均要求全面加强项目建设要素保障。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:阿里巴巴普惠体\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 30pt; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:阿里巴巴普惠体\">为加强资金来源保障，李超表示，在扩大有效投资方面，落实超长期特别国债支持国家重大战略实施和重点领域安全能力建设，加快中央预算内投资下达和地方政府专项债券发行使用进度。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:阿里巴巴普惠体\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 30pt; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:阿里巴巴普惠体\">政府投资带动下，信贷资金将发挥重要作用。日前，重庆市举办了<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>政银企<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>融资对接会。人民银行重庆市分行副行长李铀介绍，金融机构将充分利用各项金融支持政策和结构性货币政策工具，提高项目对接效率，丰富融资服务手段，多维度提升项目资金满足度。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:阿里巴巴普惠体\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 30pt; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:阿里巴巴普惠体\">东方金诚首席宏观分析师王青表示，超长期特别国债、抵押补充贷款、万亿国债等资金将带动银行配套贷款跟进，为基建投资保持较快增长提供充足的资金来源。预计基建投资形成实物工作量的速度会加快。在政府债券发行及配套基建贷款投放节奏加快后，<span lang=\"EN-US\">5</span>月基建投资有望再提速。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:阿里巴巴普惠体\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 30pt; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:阿里巴巴普惠体\">此外，用能、用地等要素保障强化也将提升重大基础设施和民生项目资源要素配置效率。日前，江苏省<span lang=\"EN-US\">114</span>个重大基础设施项目纳入国家配置用地计划范围，入选项目将通过<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>免申即享<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>方式直接配置用地计划，涉及总用地<span lang=\"EN-US\">14.86</span>万亩、新增建设用地<span lang=\"EN-US\">11.58</span>万亩。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n</section>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:阿里巴巴普惠体\">&nbsp;</span></p>"}